  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). A Streamlit dashboard that turns a cleaned WHO FluNet country-week export into influenza positivity trends with confidence intervals, a seasonal decomposition, EARS/CUSUM alert screening, detector evaluation, a one-week-ahead forecast benchmark and a documented data-quality audit. Data used in the run: synthetic. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
